Package: samacrobrief
Title: South African Macro Release-Day Briefing Pipeline
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Reinhard", "Laak", email = "306564783+reinhardlaaksofficial-hub@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Ingests Statistics South Africa statistical releases (CPI, PPI,
    GDP, QLFS), computes standard analytical aggregates, and renders a
    one-page PDF briefing note with charts. Basic data are sourced from
    Statistics South Africa; all applications and analysis result from our
    own processing of the data.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.3)
Imports:
    readxl, pdftools, rvest, httr2, dplyr, tidyr, stringr, lubridate,
    ggplot2, yaml, here, targets, testthat, quarto, optparse, zip
